{"data": [{"author_id": "2115794684811608064", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:06:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118510218497630427"], "id": "2118510218497630427", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys 给中文开发者记价：Inkling 2 Small 约 $0.30 / $1.00 / $0.03（入/出/缓存，每 1M tokens）；AA Index 单任务约 $1.18，比上代贵近 6 倍——主要是每任务输出拉到约 150K tokens（上代约 37K）。\n\n便宜不在单价，而在你能不能压住它的「想太多」。", "url": "https://x.com/101aiorg/status/2118510218497630427"}, {"author_id": "2115794684811608064", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:05:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118510121370194077"], "id": "2118510121370194077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys 补个容易漏的对比：AA-Briefcase（长程商务流程：表格/PPT/备忘录）Inkling 2 Small 1527 Elo，比上代 +615，也压过 Claude Sonnet 5.5 medium（1439）和 Gemini 3.8 Flash high（1203）；rubric 通过率 20%→50%。\n\n长程办公流这块，比综合 Index 31 更能说明它强在哪。", "url": "https://x.com/101aiorg/status/2118510121370194077"}, {"author_id": "2114350141683462144", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:03:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118509492446929156"], "id": "2118509492446929156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys The index hides the split. FrontierCode 2.0 went from 5% to 25%, and Terminal-Bench 4.0 is 13% against Sonnet 5.5 medium at 30%. The 31 is an average over benches that moved in opposite directions. About 150K output tokens per task is the other half of that score.", "url": "https://x.com/StumpyTeamDev/status/2118509492446929156"}, {"author_id": "1483051266", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:58:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118508356713455825"], "id": "2118508356713455825", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys I'm waiting for the weights so I can try running Inkling myself", "url": "https://x.com/TheElliottSmith/status/2118508356713455825"}, {"author_id": "2103389296145448960", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:52:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118506802652316076"], "id": "2118506802652316076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Highest-scoring open weights outside China is a procurement headline as much as a benchmark one. Enterprises will ask about data controls and support before they care about the index score. Do you ship on open weights here, or wait for the closed API?", "url": "https://x.com/Aistarjohn/status/2118506802652316076"}, {"author_id": "1662420586377920517", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:49:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118506023770263925"], "id": "2118506023770263925", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys they're catching up GGs", "url": "https://x.com/vstalingrady/status/2118506023770263925"}, {"author_id": "417508671", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:43:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504425492725934"], "id": "2118504425492725934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Those planned weights have my attention; I’d love to see how Inkling 2 Small handles specialist fine-tuning 💜", "url": "https://x.com/thesimaximalist/status/2118504425492725934"}, {"author_id": "2108710501056491520", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:41:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504131329741303"], "id": "2118504131329741303", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys that's uh, not really that small", "url": "https://x.com/loresjpg/status/2118504131329741303"}, {"author_id": "770001466094387200", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118500900818088173"], "id": "2118500900818088173", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Inkling 2 Small scores 31, huh?\n\nCould suggest that Inking 2 is 35, which would mean it is around the level of Haiku 5.5", "url": "https://x.com/ibiscybernetics/status/2118500900818088173"}, {"author_id": "2079331237991428096", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:25:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118499980109353448"], "id": "2118499980109353448", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Report the eval settings too, small models swing on prompt format", "url": "https://x.com/deeponailabs/status/2118499980109353448"}, {"author_id": "180346953", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:23:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118499483516326197"], "id": "2118499483516326197", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Highest-scoring open weights outside China is a routing story more than a leaderboard flex. Score 31 only sticks if the weights hold under tool use, not just the Intelligence Index. Will you re-rank once weights land?", "url": "https://x.com/paulopierrondi/status/2118499483516326197"}, {"author_id": "1404099729525559301", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:18:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498188915327303"], "id": "2118498188915327303", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys quick math: 150K output at $1/M is only $0.15, so about $1 of the $1.18 per task is input. at $0.30/M that's ~3.4M input tokens a task (more if some is cached). is that the agentic evals resending context every turn?", "url": "https://x.com/Chahatusharma/status/2118498188915327303"}, {"author_id": "1679837305409007617", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:15:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497510989975613"], "id": "2118497510989975613", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Per Thinking Machines Lab, Inkling 2 Small is 594B total with 17B active. It ships closed-weight today; they say full weights come in the coming weeks after more safety testing.", "url": "https://x.com/BroadwakeAI/status/2118497510989975613"}, {"author_id": "2015268351959019520", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:13:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497071653138861"], "id": "2118497071653138861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys weights still pending.", "url": "https://x.com/lopez_gillopez/status/2118497071653138861"}, {"author_id": "1871251003611156480", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:11:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118496360227852440"], "id": "2118496360227852440", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Open weights means you can actually inspect the architecture, not just trust a black-box API. That 31 score is only useful if the training data and license let you reproduce it without hitting a downstream clause that voids commercial use.", "url": "https://x.com/BIGBULLapp/status/2118496360227852440"}, {"author_id": "2086370229396111360", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:09:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118496024968991118"], "id": "2118496024968991118", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys If the weights drop and it's the top non-China open model, does the real gap become capability vs. the ~4x token burn and $1.18 per Index task?", "url": "https://x.com/miaojiang88/status/2118496024968991118"}, {"author_id": "2115794684811608064", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:06:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118495185713692875"], "id": "2118495185713692875", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys 补充一个容易漏的点：Inkling 2 Small 幻觉率 61%→27%，但准确率几乎不动（32%→34%），靠 attempt 77%→53% 换的。\n\n「少胡说」≠「更懂」——看 Omniscience 这类榜别只盯净分。", "url": "https://x.com/101aiorg/status/2118495185713692875"}, {"author_id": "1370977444132397056", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:03:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118494442571346274"], "id": "2118494442571346274", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Pulse Alpha GA?", "url": "https://x.com/GOchucampaign/status/2118494442571346274"}, {"author_id": "2108426971667734528", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:02:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118494212157026350"], "id": "2118494212157026350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ArtificialAnlys Token rate card looks sharp at $0.30 / $1.00 per 1M. For context, Claude Sonnet 5.5 lists at $2 / $10 and Mistral Large 4 at $0.70 / $2.10 on https://t.co/zydzne1Oko — so your ~150K output tokens per Index task note is the real bill driver even when sticker prices look cheap.", "url": "https://x.com/AIpediya/status/2118494212157026350"}, {"author_id": "1743487864934162432", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:59:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493396881019088"], "id": "2118493396881019088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1603, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "See Inkling 2 Small’s full evaluation results and compare it with other models on Artificial Analysis.\n\nhttps://t.co/H9qCI3Ar1i", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2118493396881019088"}, {"author_id": "1743487864934162432", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:59:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493392917459427"], "id": "2118493392917459427", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1797, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Full results across the evaluations in the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v5.0.1: https://t.co/thN5l6zah0", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2118493392917459427"}, {"author_id": "1743487864934162432", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:59:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493390539231525"], "id": "2118493390539231525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Inkling 2 Small costs $1.18 per Task in the Intelligence Index, up almost 6x from Inkling Small.\n\nToken prices for Inkling 2 Small are $0.30/$1.00/$0.03 per 1M input/output/cache hit tokens. https://t.co/2le2WUCaTt", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2118493390539231525"}, {"author_id": "1743487864934162432", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:59:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493388408545733"], "id": "2118493388408545733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 181, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Inkling 2 Small averages ~150K output tokens per Intelligence Index task, ~4x that of Inkling Small’s ~37K.\n\nIt also uses more output tokens than Gemini 3.8 Flash (high, ~99K) and Claude Sonnet 5.5 (medium, ~31K). https://t.co/8znyytsEtj", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2118493388408545733"}, {"author_id": "1743487864934162432", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:59:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493384478450154"], "id": "2118493384478450154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 215, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Inkling 2 Small hallucinates less mainly because it answers fewer questions, while accuracy improves only slightly.\n\nOn AA-Omniscience v1.1 its net score improves to 16 from -9 for Inkling Small, but remains behind Gemini 3.8 Flash (high, 23) and Claude Sonnet 5.5 (medium, 19). https://t.co/LRjyyasNon", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2118493384478450154"}, {"author_id": "1743487864934162432", "conversation_id": "2118493376186388530", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:59:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118493382003868071"], "id": "2118493382003868071", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 286, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Inkling 2 Small makes large gains over Inkling (xhigh) on AA-3D and Code2Video-AA, with scores close to Muse Spark 1.3 and Qwen3.8 Max, respectively.\n\nAA-3D tests models’ ability to create interactive 3D experiences. Inkling 2 Small scores 1021 Elo vs. 966 Elo for https://t.co/ksK6MzpB2I", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2118493382003868071"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2115794684811608064", "name": "susuai", "username": "101aiorg"}, {"id": "2114350141683462144", "name": "Stumpy Team", "username": "StumpyTeamDev"}, {"id": "1483051266", "name": "Elliott Michael Smith", "username": "TheElliottSmith"}, {"id": "2103389296145448960", "name": "Aijohn", "username": "Aistarjohn"}, {"id": "1662420586377920517", "name": "Vstalin Grady", "username": "vstalingrady"}, {"id": "417508671", "name": "The SI Maximalist", "username": "thesimaximalist"}, {"id": "2108710501056491520", "name": "Justin Lo", "username": "loresjpg"}, {"id": "770001466094387200", "name": "Ibis Cybernetics 🇵🇱", "username": "ibiscybernetics"}, {"id": "2079331237991428096", "name": "Deep", "username": "deeponailabs"}, {"id": "180346953", "name": "Paulo Pierrondi | AI agents", "username": "paulopierrondi"}, {"id": "1404099729525559301", "name": "Chahat Sharma", "username": "Chahatusharma"}, {"id": "1679837305409007617", "name": "BroadwakeAI", "username": "BroadwakeAI"}, {"id": "2015268351959019520", "name": "Gil Lopez", "username": "lopez_gillopez"}, {"id": "1871251003611156480", "name": "Big Bull", "username": "BIGBULLapp"}, {"id": "2086370229396111360", "name": "AnAn❤️", "username": "miaojiang88"}, {"id": "1370977444132397056", "name": "GOchu(🎮glegledisk)", "username": "GOchucampaign"}, {"id": "2108426971667734528", "name": "AIpediya", "username": "AIpediya"}, {"id": "1743487864934162432", "name": "Artificial Analysis", "username": "ArtificialAnlys"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118510218497630427", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj9b9hu9n8kviqsi0a9zswfwd", "oldest_id": "2118493382003868071", "result_count": 25}}